WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.133 --> 00:00:02.369
He is forever young
 and he has kept us young.

00:00:04.571 --> 00:00:05.405
He likes me?

00:00:05.405 --> 00:00:08.641
Yes, that’s his way of saying
he’s happy to meet you.

00:00:08.641 --> 00:00:09.776
What’s up Doc?

00:00:12.479 --> 00:00:13.480
Guess who?

00:00:14.247 --> 00:00:16.883
I never thought that someday
I’d be standing here.

00:00:16.883 --> 00:00:18.385
What a party!

00:00:18.385 --> 00:00:19.819
We’re movie stars.

00:00:20.053 --> 00:00:23.323
This is the Oscars.
 It's supposed to be formal.

00:00:23.556 --> 00:00:25.291
Well, I would explain all
the penguins then. 

00:00:29.262 --> 00:00:30.263
Nice tux.

00:00:30.263 --> 00:00:31.865
Ha. Nice shoes!

00:00:31.865 --> 00:00:34.200
One, two, three, five toes?

00:00:34.567 --> 00:00:35.735
We're here to present
the award

00:00:35.735 --> 00:00:37.470
for Best Animated Short Film

00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:41.141
because we're animated
and we are short.

00:00:41.441 --> 00:00:42.409
And the envelope loops in.

00:00:43.376 --> 00:00:44.177
Whoops, um...

00:00:49.249 --> 00:00:50.850
Ride like the wind Bullseye!

00:00:50.850 --> 00:00:53.186
The show’s running long.

00:00:53.453 --> 00:00:54.921
You forgot something. 

00:00:57.657 --> 00:01:00.627
And the Oscar goes to...

00:01:00.627 --> 00:01:02.062
Hurry up, hurry up. 

00:01:02.062 --> 00:01:04.798
Alison Snowden
and David Fine

00:01:04.798 --> 00:01:06.099
The ChubbChubbs!

00:01:06.099 --> 00:01:06.666
Way miserable inside out. Shrek.

00:01:06.666 --> 00:01:07.133
Les Misérables

00:01:07.133 --> 00:01:08.134
Inside Out

00:01:08.134 --> 00:01:08.701
Shrek

00:01:09.602 --> 00:01:10.336
Aron Warner

00:01:23.650 --> 00:01:25.518
Thank you so much
to The Academy 

00:01:25.518 --> 00:01:27.220
and everybody out there that supported this film

00:01:27.220 --> 00:01:28.221
there were lots of you.

00:01:28.688 --> 00:01:29.989
We share this award with you. 

00:01:29.989 --> 00:01:31.558
If anyone's ever done
 this kind of stuff before, 

00:01:31.558 --> 00:01:32.559
you know it's about
the team,

00:01:32.559 --> 00:01:33.560
it's not about the individual. 

00:01:33.560 --> 00:01:35.228
Now we are very proud of it.

00:01:35.228 --> 00:01:36.529
 We are really happy right now.

00:01:36.696 --> 00:01:37.163
Thank you.

00:01:37.163 --> 00:01:38.131
Thank you very much.

00:01:38.131 --> 00:01:38.898
Thank you.

00:01:39.032 --> 00:01:39.499
Thank you.

00:01:39.732 --> 00:01:40.767
Thank you all!

00:01:40.767 --> 00:01:42.802
(As Donald Duck)
Thank you very much.

00:01:42.802 --> 00:01:44.404
(As Donald Duck)
I love you all.

00:01:45.405 --> 00:01:46.606
Thank you. Thank you. 

00:01:47.407 --> 00:01:50.310
You can make stuff,
make films,

00:01:50.310 --> 00:01:53.346
draw, write, it will
 make a world of difference.

